{"id":"1ba32eb645e558b7052994051ae3ab03b3269b50","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1229979","title":"max 还是得一直开着，否则总是忘记切","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"morewe","excerpt":"OpenAI - @morewe - 有时候小任务会切到 5.6sol high 或者 xhigh 。结果每次都忘记切回来，然后开了好几个对话才发现不对。决定以后还是一直开着 5.6sol max 了。fast 倒是不必，","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/morewe\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/19b7ed4caafc4a090d0defd5730be1c2?s=73&d=retro\" alt=\"morewe\" data-uid=\"130223\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/morewe\">morewe</a> · <span title=\"2026-07-27 01:29:21 +08:00\">23h 12m ago</span> · 1313 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>有时候小任务会切到 5.6sol high 或者 xhigh 。<br>结果每次都忘记切回来，然后开了好几个对话才发现不对。</p><p>决定以后还是一直开着 5.6sol max 了。<br>fast 倒是不必，毕竟不赶时间。<br>今早还有张重置卡要过期，结果周限还有 80%+。</p><p>各位平时都用啥模型？</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a><a href=\"/tag/设置\"><li></li> 设置</a><a href=\"/tag/对话\"><li></li> 对话</a></P><p><span>8 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-27 15:30:08 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17905656\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/afb754bcdcb636feb0944001167faba3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"simonsww\" data-uid=\"95364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/simonsww\">simonsww</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-27 01:33:57 +08:00\">23h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ultra 和 max 哪个更高一些啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <d